  "translation": "Long wanem, long san Yahwe strongpela tru i stap bilong yumi, olsem ples bilong ol wara, ol kanal hangere olsem ol han; sip bilong wasira i no inap wokabaut long em, na bikpela sip i no ken i go long em.",
